---
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Meta Ads Specialist · Dal 2017</p>

      <h1 class="headline">
        Più fatturato<br />dal tuo e-commerce.<br />
        <em>Con Meta Ads che<br />funzionano davvero.</em>
      </h1>

      <p class="subtitle">
        Broad targeting, creative is the targeting, decisioni basate sui dati.<br />
        Nessuna formula magica — solo metodo, test e scalabilità.
      </p>

      <div class="actions">
        <a href="/contatti" class="btn-primary">Richiedi una consulenza gratuita</a>
        <a href="/case-study" class="btn-secondary">Guarda i risultati →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-number">€500k+</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Budget ads / anno</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-number">7+</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Anni di esperienza</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-number">8</span>
          <span class="stat-label">Brand attivi</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 7rem 0 6rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-divider);
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 840px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-mid);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .headline {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 5.5vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .headline em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-mid);
    line-height: 1.75;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    border-radius: 2px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.85; }

  .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-text);
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { opacity: 0.55; }

  .stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-divider);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-mid);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 4rem 0;
    }
    .headline {
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 8vw, 2.75rem);
    }
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    .stats {
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
